1
00:00:00,620 --> 00:00:03,200
(Transcribed by TurboScribe. Go Unlimited to remove this message.) Most students have to take a final exam.

2
00:00:04,320 --> 00:00:06,000
It is the most important exam.

3
00:00:06,820 --> 00:00:08,760
It makes up most of your grade.

4
00:00:09,620 --> 00:00:12,000
It can raise your grade a lot, or

5
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:12,800
drop it.

6
00:00:13,440 --> 00:00:14,620
It is usually long.

7
00:00:15,420 --> 00:00:19,340
It is usually cumulative, which means that it

8
00:00:19,340 --> 00:00:22,100
includes information from the beginning of class.

9
00:00:23,140 --> 00:00:26,260
This means you have to remember everything.

10
00:00:26,260 --> 00:00:29,040
You should study a lot for it.

11
00:00:29,740 --> 00:00:31,759
The test might be multiple choice.

12
00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:34,200
The test might be an essay.

13
00:00:35,020 --> 00:00:37,480
The test might be fill in the blank.

14
00:00:38,380 --> 00:00:40,500
Remember to get good rest.

15
00:00:41,260 --> 00:00:43,500
Also, eat a healthy breakfast.

16
00:00:44,180 --> 00:00:45,640
Nothing with too much sugar.

17
00:00:46,600 --> 00:00:48,500
Eat something like a fruit salad.

18
00:00:49,240 --> 00:00:51,020
Don't eat pancakes with syrup.

19
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:52,800
Good luck!
